# build
resources
dist
build/*
!build/entitlements.mac.plist

# pouch
# The .webhapp is COMMITTED, deliberately, rather than ignored. CI needs
# it to build, and Kangaroo offers exactly two ways to give it one: a
# `webhapp` URL plus sha256 in kangaroo.config.ts, or the file in git.
# The URL option needs somewhere to host it, and the app repo publishes no
# releases yet, so there is nothing to point at. ~1.7MB per version.
# pouch/*.webhapp

